on":1,"script":{"functions":[{"description":"Perform a HTTP/HTTPS request.\n\nIf no timeout value is passed, the configuration value \"network.http_timeout\" is used. If that is not set, the timeout value is `0` (which blocks indefinitely).\n\n**Examples:**\n\nBasic HTTP-GET request. The callback receives a table with the response\nin the fields status, the response (the data) and headers (a table).\n\n```lua\nlocal function http_result(self, _, response)\n    if response.bytes_total ~= nil then\n        update_my_progress_bar(self, response.bytes_received / response.bytes_total)\n    else\n        print(response.status)\n        print(response.response)\n        pprint(response.headers)\n    end\nend\n\nfunction init(self)\n    http.request(\"http://www.google.com\", \"GET\", http_result, nil, nil, { report_progress = true })\nend\n```\n\n[Open in Browser](https://defold.com/ref/http-lua#http.request:url-method-callback-headers-post_data-options)","disposition":"generated-lua-bridge","generics":[],"id":"script:http.request","jsName":"request","line":48,"member":"request","modulePath":["http"],"overloads":[],"parameters":[{"description":"target url","optional":false,"rawName":"url","rawType":"string"},{"description":"HTTP/HTTPS method, e.g. \"GET\", \"PUT\", \"POST\" etc.","optional":false,"rawName":"method","rawType":"string"},{"description":"response callback function  `self` `script_instance` The current script instance  `id` `hash` Internal message identifier. Do not use!","optional":false,"rawName":"callback","rawType":"fun(self:script_instance, id:hash, response:http.response)"},{"description":"optional table with custom headers","optional":true,"rawName":"headers","rawType":"table<string, string>"},{"description":"optional data to send","optional":true,"rawName":"post_data","rawType":"string"},{"description":"optional request options","optional":true,"rawName":"options","rawType":"http.request_options"}],"rawName":"http.request","returnDescriptions":[],"retur